## Lane Discipline

This project has multiple lanes.<% if (_codeLanes.length >= 2) { %> **Cross-stack rule:** if your task touches both **<%= _codeLanes.join('** and **') %>**, STOP and split into separate tasks/PRs.<% } %>

| Lane | Scope | Test command |
|------|-------|--------------|
<% if (_lanes.includes('frontend')) { %>| **frontend** | Files under `frontend/` | `<%= testCommand %> --filter frontend` |
<% } %><% if (_lanes.includes('backend')) { %>| **backend** | Files under `backend/` | `<%= testCommand %> --filter backend` |
<% } %><% if (_lanes.includes('docs')) { %>| **docs** | Files under `docs/` | Documentation review only — no code gate |
<% } %>
Before implementation: identify which lane(s) your change touches. If only one lane — proceed. If multiple — STOP and request split.
<% } %>

